WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.500
I come from the mountain forests,

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.500
I dive into the deep sea,

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.500
I come from meteors and dwell in bubbles,

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.500
I come from the future and go to the past,

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.500
from ink wash into woodcut,

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.500
no up or down, no front or back,

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.200
no inside or outside, no big or small.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.200
I am everywhere, without beginning or end.

